WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.271
Phone validation first strips punctuation and other
non-digit characters Then

00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:11.923
it checks whether the resulting candidate has ten
digits Missing values

00:00:11.949 --> 00:00:17.967
are separated from invalid-shaped values This is a
good pattern normalize

00:00:17.993 --> 00:00:21.072
representation first then apply the validation rule
